    "body": "fix on issue/4455-holder-form-largest-dia - PR #4469 - pinned by a_body_the_flange_envelope_covers_is_not_read_back_smaller, each_builtin_taper_holder_reads_back_as_its_shape, a_copied_holder_shows_the_largest_diameter_of_its_outline_and_applies_as_it_is, mcp_edit_user_holder_refuses_a_body_the_flange_envelope_covers - merges when reviewed\n\nThe pre-review findings are fixed on head `1e899ad44`. `edit_user_holder` gets the same fix (Done-means item 3). The library shrink exception is removed: a covered shrink-fit body never reads back, so no read-back value can be smaller than the steel.\n",
